## Integration acceptance

- Verify mount/unmount, duplicate imports, native node replacement, safe/recovery mode and default-theme restoration for every supported adapter.
- Check the installed release and component versions before upgrading a compatibility claim from source-inspected to tested.
- Every new claimed family has a versioned evidence row and fallback; unsupported families remain explicit.

Record actual environment, versions, state, method and result using the [native task accessibility matrix](native-task-accessibility.html). Source review and a local example do not establish physical execution, screen-reader usability or live compatibility.

